\"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"\\\"His skillset, work rate, and winning mentality make him an ideal fit for our team, and we're confident he'll be a huge asset in our push for domestic and European success.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Sobralense, who has previously plied his trade in Brazil's top flight with Atlético Paranaense, brings a wealth of experience and quality to the IFK Göteborg midfield.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"The Brazilian's impressive statistics, including 12 goals and 15 assists in 50 appearances for his former club, are a testament to his attacking prowess and vision on the pitch.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"I'm incredibly excited to join IFK Göteborg and contribute to the team's success,\\\" Sobralense said in a statement.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"The club's rich history, passionate fan base, and commitment to developing young players made this an opportunity I couldn't pass up.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"I'm looking forward to getting started and helping the team achieve its goals.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The signing is seen as a major coup for IFK Göteborg, who have been seeking to bolster their midfield options following the departure of key players during the winter transfer window.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Sobralense's arrival is expected to provide a significant boost to the team's attacking capabilities, and his experience playing in Brazil's top flight is likely to prove invaluable in the club's quest for domestic and European glory.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"Data from leading football analytics firm, Opta Sports, reveals that Sobralense's creative output has been consistently high throughout his career, with an average of 2.5 key passes per 90 minutes and a passing accuracy of 85% in the opposition's half.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"With Sobralense now on board, IFK Göteborg will be looking to build on their impressive start to the season, which has seen 